### Admin RBAC API Tests

### 1. Admin Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 2. Get Current Admin
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 3. Create Admin User (SUPER_ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/admins
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_admin",
  "password": "secure_password",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 4. List Admin Users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/admins
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 5. Reset Admin Password (SUPER_ADMIN only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/admins/ADMIN_ID/password
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "new_secure_password"
}

### 6. Update Admin Status (SUPER_ADMIN only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/admins/ADMIN_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DISABLED"
}

### 7. Get Audit Logs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
